    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This\r\n\r\n**Expected Behavior:**\r\nClicking the star button should change it from \"Not Saved\" to \"Saved\" and turn the button golden.\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. **Test it:**\r\n   Run the code and click the button once.\r\n   What happens (or doesn’t happen)?\r\n\r\n2. **Check the basics:** Look for small mistakes that can break the connection between the button and the action.\r\n\r\n<details style=\"margin-top:6px;margin-left:20px;margin-bottom:6px;\">\r\n        <summary><strong>View Debugging Checklist</strong></summary>\r\n        <ul style=\"margin-top:6px;\">\r\n          <li><strong>Selector match:</strong> Does the JavaScript selector match the HTML <code>id</code> or <code>class</code> exactly?</li>\r\n          <li><strong>Element exists:</strong> Is that element actually on the page?</li>\r\n          <li><strong>Order:</strong> Are elements selected before they're used?</li>\r\n          <li><strong>Event setup:</strong> Is <code>'click'</code> spelled right (not <code>'onclick'</code>)?</li>\r\n          <li><strong>Handler:</strong> Does the code actually change the page (text, image, etc.)?</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n      </details>\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n3. **Ask AI for help:** If you're stuck, describe what's happening and ask:\r\n\r\n   > Why isn't this button working? Here's the error or result: [insert error here]. Explain it in beginner terms and suggest what to check first.\r\n\r\n4. **Fix and verify:** Work with AI to make one precise change If it's still not working, discuss what to try next and keep refining until the feature behaves as expected.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "The star should flip between \"Saved\" and \"Not saved\" when you click it, but it doesn't react at all. Fix it so the star actually changes.",
